# Default memory root directory (used when memory_root is not provided; defaults to the current directory)

voicemem_memory/
examples/example_memory/

# Memory spaces: **directory structure** is committed to the repository; data inside is not.

# After cloning, there are two empty folders — demo (for running the demo) and myvoicemem (your own).

# Each user accumulates their own memory; no one's memory is pushed to the repository.

# Memory Space: only empty directories are committed; **no memory content is ever committed to the repository**.

# One language per space (demo-zh / demo-en) — retrieval uses vectors, so mixing Chinese and English in one database

# will cause half of the memories to become difficult to retrieve. The demo uses the corresponding space based on the language,

# and switching the language in the top-right corner switches the memory space.

voicemem_memoryspace/*
!voicemem_memoryspace/demo-zh/
!voicemem_memoryspace/demo-en/
!voicemem_memoryspace/myvoicemem/
voicemem_memoryspace/demo-zh/*
voicemem_memoryspace/demo-en/*
voicemem_memoryspace/myvoicemem/*
!voicemem_memoryspace/demo-zh/.gitkeep
!voicemem_memoryspace/demo-en/.gitkeep
!voicemem_memoryspace/myvoicemem/.gitke
p
